{"id": "EUVD-2026-55348", "enisaUuid": "badec4f1-b20c-374b-a296-c30c126eb222", "description": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\ndrm/i915/bios: range check LFP Data Block panel_type2\n\nWhile the panel_type from LFP Data Block is range checked, panel_type2\nis not. Add a few helpers for range checking, and use them to not only\ncheck panel_type2, but also improve clarity and correctness in the panel\ntype selection.\n\nDiscovered using AI-assisted static analysis confirmed by Intel Product\nSecurity.\n\nv2:\n- Fix commit message typo (Micha\u0142)\n- Add is_panel_type_pnp() (Ville)\n\n(cherry picked from commit c9ebe5d2f25729d6cfbbb1235d640bf67f9275df)", "datePublished": "2026-08-10T12:01:13", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-21T12:43:39", "baseScore": 0.0, "references": ["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/dc30139679354860faf8ca6a0f231cd39d692db7", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/e7b5694645b03e80830dc141b59fc65aac693c70", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/8b2da44446f9dce2ae50fee78bac2734d4277143", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/8887b94d2fc93071bf6ff09c39d474510e6f582f", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/2084503f2d087bf956198e7f6eb25b03a7049cb2"], "aliases": ["GHSA-7xvp-vq9h-5h28", "CVE-2026-68247"], "assigner": "Linux", "epss": 0.17, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "170343e9-ba68-3b89-ab80-43a5e8b50792", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 6.18.42"}, {"id": "1fffd285-e2b4-338b-a9ff-9ea249919836", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "6434cf630086eea2d091f122f5802582a05d9d1c <2084503f2d087bf956198e7f6eb25b03a7049cb2"}, {"id": "2b7345cc-7c70-33f9-91c7-57d8c0c44b5f", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 0"}, {"id": "2f763bac-422f-3260-8ae9-c5b0c6911300", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "6434cf630086eea2d091f122f5802582a05d9d1c <e7b5694645b03e80830dc141b59fc65aac693c